 "substitutedBy": null,
 "summary": "Authorizes the commissioner of general services to transfer and convey by a 99-year lease certain unappropriated state land to the Sing Sing Prison Museum; requires the department of corrections and community supervision shall enter into a management agreement with such museum that would include, but not be limited to, requirements for operating such museum, the ongoing needs of the Sing Sing Correctional Facility with regard to safety and security, and a description of the property boundaries for the leased property and easement; makes related provisions.",
 "title": "Authorizes the commissioner of general services to transfer and convey certain unappropriated state land to the Sing Sing Prison Museum",
